title Cassette bound (CASSETTE_DEMO=1): the scripted card is pulled 4 s after the start while recording (the take is closed and kept, the no sound input page), and comes back at 8 s (found by itself)
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO 1
env CASSETTE_DEMO_HOME demo-home
env CASSETTE_DEMO_UNPLUG_MS 4000
env CASSETTE_DEMO_REPLUG_MS 8000
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 1200
tap "REC"
wait 1500
shot recording-before-unplug
wait 2300
expect text "No sound input found. Plug in a USB sound card or headset."
expect text "The sound card was unplugged"
say the unplug notice shows (strip, or the whole counter row at 320x480) and the layout check passes with it
shot unplugged
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
wait 4500
expect notext "No sound input found. Plug in a USB sound card or headset."
expect text "CARD"
shot replugged
key l
wait 700
expect text "Take 001"
shot list-take-kept
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
